# The build context is the repo root, so server/.dockerignore is never read: without these,
# `COPY server ./server` shipped server/.env-cmdrc (dev env-cmd config, a DATABASE_URL) into the
# prod image. Prod reads env from compose; nothing in the image loads these files.
# frontend/.env is deliberately NOT excluded — the Vite build reads VITE_APP_VERSION from it.
server/.env*
